Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?Let=20a=20project's=20year=20span=20a=20range,?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20e.g.=202020=E2=80=932024?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The project year was a single required number. Adds an optional
yearEnd alongside it in the admin — left empty for a project that
happened in one year, same as before — and a formatYearRange() helper
that renders "2020" on its own or "2020–2024" once yearEnd is set and
actually differs, used everywhere the year is shown: the grid card,
the case-study "Anno" field, and the share-image.

Includes the hand-written Postgres migration adding year_end /
version_year_end (numeric, matching year / version_year), since this
is a schema change and the project's db config only auto-pushes
schema in development.

